# ./fmx is a real package a developer runs `just test-fmx` in, so its venv and build output live
# here on a laptop (35 MB) and are tarred into every build without this file. The image builds fmx
# from source with uv; none of this is input.
fmx/.venv
fmx/dist
fmx/build
fmx/.pytest_cache
fmx/**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
*.log
